# Number theory: the study of the integers, their primes, divisibility, congruences, and Diophantine equations. It is
# where the simplest objects hide the deepest questions. The machine-checked results in this library (the arithmetic
# laws, the summation identities by induction, the Pythagorean parametrization, the modular bounds) are number theory;
# this note marks the area, with the proofs in the number files.
